OL,3,ATenth woman's body found in South
OL,4,AAfrica suburb as police probe killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in South Africa say that they
OL,7,Fhave found a woman's body in a
OL,8,FJohannesburg suburb, the tenth in
OL,9,Frecent months.
OL,11,FThe body was found on Saturday morning
OL,12,Fand identified by the friend with whom
OL,13,Fshe had been at a bar the previous
OL,14,Fevening.
OL,16,FThe local police commissioner said his
OL,17,Fforce could not rule out the
OL,18,Fpossibility that there was a serial
OL,19,Fkiller on the loose, noting
OL,20,Fsimilarities across the 10 deaths in
OL,21,FEkurhuleni, as well as another in
OL,22,FSoweto.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
