OL,3,ATenth woman's body found in South
OL,4,AAfrica suburb as police probe killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deaths have sparked a national
OL,7,Foutcry about the scale of violence
OL,8,Fagainst women in the country, which has
OL,9,Fone of the highest rates of
OL,10,Fgender-based violence in the world.
